Package: isomd5sum
Version: 1.2.5
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: isomd5sum Maintainers <anaconda-devel-list@redhat.com>
Installed-Size: 99
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libpopt0 (>= 1.14)
Suggests: isomd5sum-doc
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/rhinstaller/isomd5sum
Description: MD5 and SHA-256 checksum tools for ISO 9660 images
 isomd5sum provides tools to implant and verify MD5 or SHA-256 checksums
 in ISO 9660 images. The checksum is stored in the application data area
 of the ISO 9660 Primary Volume Descriptor, allowing integrity verification
 directly from the ISO file or from physical media.
 .
 This package contains the command-line tools: checkisomd5, implantisomd5,
 checkisosha, and implantisosha.
